OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start with sunny
OL,6,Fspells in-between scattered showers.
OL,7,FTurning cloudier into the afternoon
OL,8,Ffrom the west, with this thickening
OL,9,Fbefore the rain arriving into the
OL,10,Fevening. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,11,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with persistent rain
OL,14,Ftonight, heavy at times into the early
OL,15,Fhours of Friday. Feeling much milder
OL,16,Fthan last night.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FRain, sometimes heavy, will
OL,19,Fclear into the afternoon to become
OL,20,Fbright with a few scattered showers
OL,21,Fand a strong westerly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
