OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FScattered showers continuing through
OL,7,FSaturday, easing into Sunday alongside
OL,8,Fwinds with sunny spells in-between.
OL,9,FCloud building through Sunday with
OL,10,Frain to follow in the evening and into
OL,11,FMonday.
